{"bundle_id":"search.fb5754563012e151c122","facts":[{"description":"The entity responsible for the assessed STR is a licensed corporation, SFC-licensed virtual asset service provider or associated entity within the circular's collective definition.; units: Boolean classification of the responsible entity","name":"responsible_entity_is_licensed_firm","type":"bool"},{"description":"There exists at least one actual submission of this same STR to the JFIU through a channel other than STREAMS 2 at or after 9:00am on 2 February 2026 in the governing timezone. Direct contact alone and automatic migration do not count as submissions. True requires evidence of a qualifying event; false requires an established history sufficient to rule out such an event. This externally supplied factual aggregate expresses the event quantifier absent from the formula language.; units: Boolean existence predicate over one STR's submission history","name":"report_has_postlaunch_other_channel_submission","type":"bool"}],"interpretations":[{"basis":"reviewer_interpretation","id":"reading","issue_ids":[],"source_span_ids":["s.da12aecad4e68.u0.0","s.da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","s.da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","s.da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","s.da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"statement":"Unreviewed interpretation: [TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] True means that the assessed licensed firm's STR has at least one submission to the JFIU through a channel other than STREAMS 2 following implementation, so the stated requirement to resubmit that STR through STREAMS 2 is triggered. False means that no such qualifying submission exists in the established event history. Unknown or incomplete event history must not be treated as false. This answers whether the resubmission trigger occurred, not whether the firm has complied with or discharged the obligation. Separately, an STR requiring urgent submission during the blackout calls for direct JFIU contact by email, phone or fax; that instruction is not evaluated by this trigger. These proposed meanings confer no legal approval."}],"rules":[{"body":{"name":"report_has_postlaunch_other_channel_submission","node_id":"body.1","op":"fact"},"id":"selected.control","interpretation_id":"reading","scope":{"name":"responsible_entity_is_licensed_firm","node_id":"scope.1","op":"fact"},"source_span_ids":["s.da12aecad4e68.u0.0","s.da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","s.da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","s.da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","s.da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool"}],"source_spans":[{"end":381,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u0.0","page":1,"quote_sha256":"93a6b160d32f2917044310722dbbaa750b9621b2026b1716d218281315fa8699","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":0,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},{"end":1939,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","page":1,"quote_sha256":"8113466ae39a17b68037319d9f35141a9e909fa6120c1bea1ebbf1f4f77fd0db","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1700,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},{"end":2129,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","page":1,"quote_sha256":"abd48d74a13a02bfe4ab0ec73a285c1fd110b2da755aa4725cd5aa4601d29f48","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":1941,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},{"end":2437,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","page":1,"quote_sha256":"d97c4864c375f491445bd6b63ad40cf3895d2013021aa9f9cec9dee3319eb0b6","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45","source_id":"da12aecad4e68","start":2131,"text_sha256":"4b0ef5d38aceea3f9aeb478e6e7fa2935e21e1fd959fd8629f6a9658b3852912"},{"end":3557,"id":"s.da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","page":1,"quote_sha256":"ff9acde946400f033ce7d1579a1d9dd927c92d61dc19575646abdc188a843b4c","raw_sha256":"63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355